      "negativeMarks": -1,
      "hint": "",
      "explanation": "",
      "media": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_1786910793821_u9mmg8",
      "text": "Suppose $a, b$ denote the distinct real roots of $x^2 + 20x - 2020$ and suppose $c, d$ denote distinct complex roots of the polynomial $x^2 - 20x + 2020$. Then the value of $ac(a-c) + ad(a-d) + bc(b-c) + bd(b-d)$ is:",
